s: the resampling stability improves dramatically with sample size, reaching perfect consistency at n=3000 and beyond, while confidence intervals narrow monotonically. The 32B model on C4 further confirms K*=2 holds at scale with tight lower bounds, reinforcing scale invariance. For the arxiv filtering integration, I just need to write this up in YAML format.\n\nBut I should ground these metrics in what they actually measure—the naturalistic validation applies our depth classifier to real web data and checks whether deeper predictions correlate with lower factual consistency and reduced vocabulary diversity. The power analysis specifically tests whether n=2000 suffices instead of our standard n=5000, which would demonstrate robustness to sample size. The 32B results already show the tight confidence interval lower bound we need.\n\nNow I'm mapping out the specific metrics to report for each experiment: depth distributions and cross-snapshot consistency for the validation, stability metrics and AUC curves across sample sizes for the power analysis, and pairwise comparisons with confidence intervals for the model scaling results.\n\nThe what_if scenario is really about how the existing data would be framed in the paper and how reviewers might receive that narrative.\n\nWriting the full YAML configuration...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49603,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49603},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8df4ac7-1a33-44a5-a0a1-8f56500212ae","uuid":"6c7c6abc-2cdc-43aa-a9cb-6c5c78929eed"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FQs7AkLr4LwEKaindLoZzv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  best 档下，原始 framing 完全成立。exp-014 自然验证和 exp-028 power curve 锦上添花，\n  exp_32b_c4 封锁 scale objection，exp-026 负向结果被审稿人视为成熟科学的标志。\n  论文以当前 2+1 claim 结构直接接收 EMNLP main。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exp-014 Naturalistic Common Crawl Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025-03 和 2026-01 snapshot 各抽 50K 文档，\n      用训练好的 15D+LightGBM depth classifier 做 depth 预测，\n      与 AlignScore、type-token ratio (TTR)、hapax legomena ratio 做 correlation。\n    expected_results:\n      n_docs_per_snapshot: 50000\n      predicted_depth_distribution_2025:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.19\n        depth_2: 0.06\n        depth_3_plus: 0.03\n      predicted_depth_distribution_2026:\n        depth_0: 0.64\n        depth_1: 0.23\n        depth_2: 0.08\n        depth_3_plus: 0.05\n      spearman_rho_alignscore_vs_predicted_depth: -0.31\n      spearman_rho_alignscore_p: \"<0.001\"\n      spearman_rho_ttr_vs_predicted_depth: -0.27\n      spearman_rho_ttr_p: \"<0.001\"\n      spearman_rho_hapax_vs_predicted_depth: -0.24\n      spearman_rho_hapax_p: \"<0.001\"\n      cross_snapshot_rank_correlation: 0.94\n      estimated_synthetic_rate_2025: 0.28\n      estimated_synthetic_rate_2026: 0.36\n      depth_2plus_rate_increase_2025_to_2026: \"+2.7pp\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下，depth classifier 在野外数据上展现有意义的 correlation，因为：\n      (1) 15D model-free features 的跨模型迁移性（80-92% retention）保证了对未知生成器的文本也有泛化能力；\n      (2) AlignScore 与 depth 的负相关反映了递归生成中的 factual drift——每代生成丢失部分事实锚定，\n      与 DPI 理论的信息单调损失一致；\n      (3) TTR 和 hapax ratio 的下降对应 vocabulary narrowing，这是 model collapse 文献\n      (Shumailov et al.) 报告的首要症状，在 prompt-chain 场景中以更温和的形式出现；\n      (4) 2026 snapshot 比 2025 有更高的合成比例（+8pp），符合 recursive contamination 加速的\n      macro trend；(5) 跨 snapshot 的 rank correlation 0.94 说明 depth predictor 的排序在\n      时间上稳定，不是对特定 snapshot 的 artifact。\n      注意 |ρ| 在 0.24-0.31 范围——这是 expected 的，因为 depth 只是文本质量的一个维度，\n      AlignScore/TTR 受主题、长度、来源等多因素影响。best 档的关键不是高 correlation，\n      而是 consistent direction + statistical significance + cross-snapshot stability。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Common Crawl Depth Distribution (2025 vs 2026)\"\n        columns: [\"Predicted Depth\", \"CC 2025-03\", \"CC 2026-01\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (human)\", \"72%\", \"64%\", \"-8pp\"]\n          - [\"1\", \"19%\", \"23%\", \"+4pp\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"6%\", \"8%\", \"+2pp\"]\n          - [\"≥3\", \"3%\", \"5%\", \"+2pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Correlation with Independent Quality Metrics\"\n        columns: [\"Quality Metric\", \"Spearman ρ vs Predicted Depth\", \"p-value\", \"Direction\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"AlignScore\", \"-0.31\", \"<0.001\", \"deeper → less factual\"]\n          - [\"Type-Token Ratio\", \"-0.27\", \"<0.001\", \"deeper → less diverse\"]\n          - [\"Hapax Ratio\", \"-0.24\", \"<0.001\", \"deeper → fewer rare words\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 2D density plot — predicted depth (x) vs AlignScore (y), with marginal histograms. 清晰展示 depth 0 cluster 与 depth 1+ 的分离，以及 depth 2+ 的 AlignScore 进一步下降。\"\n      - \"Fig: Stacked bar chart comparing 2025 vs 2026 depth distributions,标注 synthetic rate increase。\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验在 best 档下提供 ecological validity，但定位为 supporting evidence 而非核心 claim。\n      论文在 Section 5.x 用一段话报告关键数字，强调三点：(1) depth predictor 在未见过的\n      wild data 上给出方向正确的排序；(2) 合成比例的时间趋势与 recursive contamination\n      concern 一致；(3) |ρ| 的 moderate magnitude 是 expected 的，不 overclaim。\n      Appendix 放完整的 per-depth breakdown 和 bootstrap CI。\n      审稿人视角：这弥补了 \"lab conditions only\" 的潜在质疑，但不是 make-or-break——\n      即使 correlation 更弱（|ρ|~0.15），核心 C1' claim 仍基于 controlled experiments。\n\n  - name: \"exp-028 Subsampling Power Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-028\"\n    description: >\n      从 exp-001 (Pythia C4, n=5000) 的完整数据中，以 n={1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} \n      做 10 次有放回 bootstrap resample，每次重新训练 LightGBM 并计算 1v2 AUC 和 K* 判定，\n      绘制 power curve 和 CI width 收敛图。\n    expected_results:\n      power_curve:\n        n_1000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6498\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.0182\n          ci_width_mean: 0.0385\n          kstar_2_fraction: 0.7\n          kstar_2_ci_lower_above_060_fraction: 0.5\n        n_2000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6528\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.0112\n          ci_width_mean: 0.0265\n          kstar_2_fraction: 0.9\n          kstar_2_ci_lower_above_060_fraction: 0.8\n        n_3000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6535\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.0085\n          ci_width_mean: 0.0215\n          kstar_2_fraction: 1.0\n          kstar_2_ci_lower_above_060_fraction: 0.9\n        n_4000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6538\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.0068\n          ci_width_mean: 0.0188\n          kstar_2_fraction: 1.0\n          kstar_2_ci_lower_above_060_fraction: 1.0\n        n_5000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6539\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.0058\n          ci_width_mean: 0.0176\n          kstar_2_fraction: 1.0\n          kstar_2_ci_lower_above_060_fraction: 1.0\n      minimum_n_for_robust_kstar: 3000\n      ci_width_convergence_rate: \"~1/√n\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下 power curve 展现清晰的收敛行为，因为：\n      (1) Pythia 1v2 AUC=0.6539 距 θ=0.60 有 5.4pp margin，属于 moderate effect size，\n      n=3000 即可稳定检测（power > 0.90）；\n      (2) CI width 按经典 1/√n 速率收缩——从 n=1000 的 ~0.039 到 n=5000 的 ~0.018，\n      这符合 bootstrap CI 的理论预期；\n      (3) n=1000 时 K*=2 判定率仅 70%，因为 individual resample 的 CI 过宽，\n      部分 CI lower 落在 0.60 以下，但 point estimate 仍以 K*=2 为主；\n      (4) n=3000 是 \"sweet spot\"——K*=2 在 10/10 resamples 稳定，CI lower > 0.60 率达 90%；\n      (5) 这一结果也解释了为什么 OLMo (1v2=0.6145, 1.45pp margin) 和 Qwen-cont (1v2=0.6112, 1.12pp margin)\n      在 n=5000 下仍 CI-robust：即使 margin 小，5000 样本足以支撑检测。\n      如果 effect size 更大（如 Pythia greedy 1v2=0.88），n=500 就够了——\n      但 continuation mode 的 boundary-pair signal 本身较弱，需要 3000+ 样本。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Power Curve — Sample Size vs K*=2 Detection Robustness\"\n        columns: [\"n\", \"Mean 1v2 AUC\", \"SD\", \"CI Width\", \"K*=2 Rate\", \"CI Lower > θ Rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1,000\", \"0.6498\", \"0.0182\", \"0.0385\", \"7/10\", \"5/10\"]\n          - [\"2,000\", \"0.6528\", \"0.0112\", \"0.0265\", \"9/10\", \"8/10\"]\n          - [\"3,000\", \"0.6535\", \"0.0085\", \"0.0215\", \"10/10\", \"9/10\"]\n          - [\"4,000\", \"0.6538\", \"0.0068\", \"0.0188\", \"10/10\", \"10/10\"]\n          - [\"5,000\", \"0.6539\", \"0.0058\", \"0.0176\", \"10/10\", \"10/10\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双 y 轴图。左轴：mean 1v2 AUC ± 1SD ribbon（蓝），水平虚线标 θ=0.60。右轴：K*=2 CI-robust detection rate（红阶梯线）。X 轴为 n。清晰展示 n=3000 为 elbow point。\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验直接回应 reviewer concern \"样本量够吗\"。best 档下的叙事：\n      (1) n=3000 足以在 Pythia（margin=5.4pp）上 100% 稳定检测 K*=2；\n      (2) 我们使用 n=5000 提供额外 margin，尤其是对 OLMo/Qwen-cont 等 weaker-signal 配置；\n      (3) arXiv K*=3 的 2v3 AUC=0.6427（margin=4.3pp）在 n=2200 下 CI-robust，\n      与 power curve 预测一致（~4pp margin at n≥2000 应有 ~80% CI-robust rate）；\n      (4) 结论：our sample sizes are well-powered for the observed effect sizes。\n      放 Appendix，主文一句话引用。\n\n  - name: \"exp_32b_c4 — Qwen2.5-32B C4 Depth Chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_32b_c4\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-32B-Instruct, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, \n      depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B. 验证 K*=2 在 32B 规模不变。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9485\n        1v2: 0.6182\n        2v3: 0.5512\n        3v4: 0.5218\n        4v5: 0.5127\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.1025\n        1v2: 0.0108\n        2v3: 0.0058\n        3v4: 0.0041\n        4v5: 0.0033\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1:\n          auc: 0.9485\n          ci_lower: 0.9448\n          ci_upper: 0.9521\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6182\n          ci_lower: 0.6088\n          ci_upper: 0.6278\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5512\n          ci_lower: 0.5408\n          ci_upper: 0.5614\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        3v4:\n          auc: 0.5218\n          ci_lower: 0.5112\n          ci_upper: 0.5325\n          perm_p: 0.0003\n        4v5:\n          auc: 0.5127\n          ci_lower: 0.5018\n          ci_upper: 0.5237\n          perm_p: 0.0092\n      bootstrap_resamples: 10000\n      permutation_resamples: 10000\n      ordinal_mae: 1.2082\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3548\n      top_features:\n        - freq_entropy\n        - surp_d1_skew\n        - surp_std\n        - surp_d1_mean\n        - surp_d2_mean\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下 32B 给出 K*=2，CI lower=0.6088 > 0.605（满足 A6），因为：\n      (1) K*=2 已在 1.4B/1.5B/7B/8B/14B 六个规模点上 consistent（C4 域），\n      32B 延续这一趋势是 DPI 理论的直接预测——K* 由 text-intrinsic information loss 决定，\n      不受模型规模调控；\n      (2) 0v1 AUC=0.9485 略低于 14B 的 0.9598，这并非 anomaly：\n      更大的模型生成更 human-like 的 gen-1 文本，使 0v1 略微收窄，\n      但仍远高于 θ（+34.85pp），binary detection 完全不受影响；\n      (3) 1v2 AUC=0.6182 与 14B 的 0.621 几乎相同（Δ=-0.3pp），\n      表明 scale 从 14B→32B 对 boundary-pair discriminability 无额外影响——\n      depth signal saturation 已在更小规模达到渐近；\n      (4) CI lower=0.6088 给出 +0.88pp margin over θ，比 LLaMA-8B 的 +0.28pp \n      和 Qwen-cont-1.5B 的 +0.15pp 更 robust，因为 32B 的生成质量更高，\n      depth-1 vs depth-2 的 feature distribution 分离略好于边缘情况；\n      (5) top features 排序与 7B/14B 一致（freq_entropy 居首），\n      确认 feature importance 的 scale invariance；\n      (6) 2v3 CI upper=0.5614 < 0.60 确认 saturation boundary 在 K*=2，\n      没有被 32B 的表达能力 \"推高\" 到 K*=3。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Scale Invariance of K* on C4 Web Text\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Scale\", \"1v2 AUC\", \"1v2 CI Lower\", \"2v3 AUC\", \"2v3 CI Upper\", \"K*\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pythia-1.4B\", \"1.4B\", \"0.6539\", \"0.6454\", \"0.5515\", \"0.5628\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-1.5B base\", \"1.5B\", \"0.6262\", \"0.6168\", \"0.5496\", \"0.5600\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-1.5B inst.\", \"1.5B\", \"0.6112\", \"0.6015\", \"0.5609\", \"0.5712\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-7B\", \"7B\", \"0.6178\", \"0.6079\", \"0.5460\", \"0.5594\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"LLaMA-3.1-8B\", \"8B\", \"0.6123\", \"0.6028\", \"0.5274\", \"0.5378\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-14B\", \"14B\", \"0.6210\", \"0.6119\", \"0.5494\", \"0.5594\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"**Qwen2.5-32B**\", \"**32B**\", \"**0.6182**\", \"**0.6088**\", \"**0.5512**\", \"**0.5614**\", \"**2**\"]\n      - name: \"Table: 32B Full Pairwise AUC Profile\"\n        columns: [\"Pair\", \"AUC\", \"95% CI\", \"perm p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0v1\", \"0.9485\", \"[0.9448, 0.9521]\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"1v2\", \"0.6182\", \"[0.6088, 0.6278]\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"2v3\", \"0.5512\", \"[0.5408, 0.5614]\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"3v4\", \"0.5218\", \"[0.5112, 0.5325]\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"4v5\", \"0.5127\", \"[0.5018, 0.5237]\", \"0.009\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: AUC decay curve — 7 model scales (1.4B→32B) 叠加绘制 pairwise AUC vs depth pair。所有曲线在 1v2→2v3 间出现 sharp drop below θ=0.60，K*=2 boundary 在所有 scales 完全重合。32B 用加粗线标注。\"\n    analysis: >\n      32B 实验在 best 档下封锁 \"只测小模型\" 的 reviewer objection。\n      关键论证链：1.4B→32B 覆盖 23× scale range，K*=2 完全不变，\n      1v2 AUC 在 [0.6112, 0.6539] 的窄 band 内，没有 scale-dependent trend。\n      这与 DPI 理论一致：K* 是 text-intrinsic lossy channel 的属性，\n      模型规模影响 gen-0→gen-1 的 fidelity（0v1 AUC 从 0.997→0.949 缓降），\n      但不改变 depth saturation point。\n      论文中放 Section 4 主表（7 行 scale comparison），一句话结论：\n      \"K*=2 is invariant across a 23× scale range (1.4B–32B).\"\n      Appendix 放完整 32B pairwise profile。\n\n  - name: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated — arXiv Negative Result Integration\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\"\n    description: >\n      将 exp-026 arXiv graduated filtering 的负向结果整合入论文：\n      Section 5 增加 arXiv null result table，Discussion 增加 \n      \"K* characterizes discriminability, not data utility\" 洞察。\n    expected_results:\n      section_5_table:\n        strategies: [\"no_filter\", \"binary\", \"graduated_a09\"]\n        mmlu: [\"0.5899±0.0008\", \"0.5876±0.0004\", \"0.5900±0.0011\"]\n        hellaswag: [\"0.6600±0.0002\", \"0.6642±0.0004\", \"0.6599±0.0003\"]\n        graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_p: 0.87\n        graduated_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_p: 0.71\n        binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_p: 0.005\n        binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_p: \"<0.00001\"\n      exp_025_pythia_table:\n        strategies: [\"no_filter\", \"binary_ours\", \"graduated_a09\"]\n        mmlu: [\"0.2568±0.0012\", \"0.2585±0.0004\", \"0.2561±0.0009\"]\n        hellaswag: [\"0.5250±0.0008\", \"0.5251±0.0001\", \"0.5253±0.0007\"]\n        max_delta: 0.0017\n        key: \"all within noise\"\n      discussion_insight: \"K* characterizes statistical discriminability of generational depth, not downstream data utility. Depth 2-3 arXiv text is distinguishable (AUC=0.64) but not necessarily detrimental for training.\"\n      reviewer_credibility_boost: \"+0.3 avg score estimated\"\n      narrative_framing: \"honest negative result as mature science\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下，负向结果整合提升而非损害论文，因为：\n      (1) exp-026 graduated ≈ no_filter 在 arXiv 上（p>0.70 both metrics）直接否定了\n      \"K*=3 意味着 graduated filtering 在 arXiv 上应该更好\" 的朴素预测——\n      但这恰恰揭示了一个更深的洞察：K* 测量的是 statistical discriminability，\n      不是 data utility。depth-2 和 depth-3 的 arXiv 文本虽然可区分（AUC=0.64），\n      但两者对下游训练的边际价值差异可能微乎其微，因为 arXiv 的结构化特征\n      （LaTeX, citations）保持了即使在高代际下的语义连贯性；\n      (2) exp-025 Pythia filtering null result（所有策略 Δ<0.002）进一步支撑：\n      小模型（1.4B）capacity 不足以从 depth-aware filtering 中获益，\n      这是 model capacity × filtering benefit 的 interaction 而非 K* 理论的失败；\n      (3) 审稿人对 honest negative results 有 well-documented positive bias——\n      EMNLP reviewer guidelines 明确鼓励报告负向结果。在 best 档下，\n      审稿人的评价会是 \"The authors demonstrate intellectual honesty by reporting \n      negative results and extracting a deeper insight\"；\n      (4) \"K* ≠ data utility\" 洞察为 future work 开辟了明确方向：\n      何时 discriminability 转化为 utility？这取决于 domain、model capacity、\n      和 contamination ratio 的三方交互——论文 honestly 承认目前不完全理解这一问题；\n      (5) binary filtering 在 C4 上的持续优势（HellaSwag p≤0.004 across 3 dose ratios）\n      与 arXiv null result 形成对比，进一步证明 domain dependence 是关键：\n      K*=2 域的 binary 策略有效 vs K*=3 域的 graduated 策略无额外收益。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (Section 5): arXiv Filtering Results (K*=3 Domain)\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"vs no_filter (MMLU)\", \"vs no_filter (HS)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"no_filter\", \"0.5899±0.0008\", \"0.6600±0.0002\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"binary\", \"0.5876±0.0004\", \"0.6642±0.0004\", \"-0.23pp (p=0.005)\", \"+0.42pp (p<10⁻⁵)\"]\n          - [\"graduated (α=0.9)\", \"0.5900±0.0011\", \"0.6599±0.0003\", \"+0.01pp (p=0.87)\", \"-0.01pp (p=0.71)\"]\n      - name: \"Table (Appendix): exp-025 Pythia Filtering Null Result\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"no_filter\", \"0.2568±0.0012\", \"0.5250±0.0008\"]\n          - [\"binary_ours\", \"0.2585±0.0004\", \"0.5251±0.0001\"]\n          - [\"graduated_a09\", \"0.2561±0.0009\", \"0.5253±0.0007\"]\n      - name: \"Table (Discussion): K* vs Filtering Effectiveness Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Domain\", \"K*\", \"Binary Advantage\", \"Graduated vs No-filter\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"C4 (web)\", \"2\", \"significant (HS p≤0.004)\", \"≈ no_filter\", \"K*=2 → binary optimal\"]\n          - [\"arXiv\", \"3\", \"metric-specific trade-off\", \"≈ no_filter\", \"discriminability ≠ utility\"]\n          - [\"Pythia C4\", \"2\", \"within noise\", \"within noise\", \"model capacity prerequisite\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双面 comparison——左 panel C4 dose-response (binary consistently above), 右 panel arXiv null result (all strategies collapsed)。视觉上立即传达 domain-dependent filtering effectiveness。\"\n    analysis: >\n      此整合是 best 档区别于其他档位的关键特征。\n      exp-025 和 exp-026 的负向结果不是弱点，而是叙事武器：\n      它们将 C3 从 \"binary filtering is universally best\" 的过度 claim\n      收窄到 \"K* predicts optimal curation granularity for domains where K*=2,\n      but discriminability does not automatically translate to filtering benefit\"——\n      这是一个更精确、更可辩护、更有科学深度的 claim。\n      Discussion 中 \"K* characterizes discriminability, not data utility\" \n      作为论文最后的概念性 takeaway 与 one-wash laundering 形成双 memorable insight。\n      审稿人评估：这一诚实报告预计提升 soundness/rigour 维度 0.3-0.5 分，\n      因为它展示了作者对 claim boundaries 的精确认知。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49603,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49603},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8df4ac7-1a33-44a5-a0a1-8f56500212ae","uuid":"585a9c6b-c33e-4f7f-af99-0b4d67fd401f"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":185035,"duration_api_ms":187318,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  best 档下，原始 framing 完全成立。exp-014 自然验证和 exp-028 power curve 锦上添花，\n  exp_32b_c4 封锁 scale objection，exp-026 负向结果被审稿人视为成熟科学的标志。\n  论文以当前 2+1 claim 结构直接接收 EMNLP main。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exp-014 Naturalistic Common Crawl Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025-03 和 2026-01 snapshot 各抽 50K 文档，\n      用训练好的 15D+LightGBM depth classifier 做 depth 预测，\n      与 AlignScore、type-token ratio (TTR)、hapax legomena ratio 做 correlation。\n    expected_results:\n      n_docs_per_snapshot: 50000\n      predicted_depth_distribution_2025:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.19\n        depth_2: 0.06\n        depth_3_plus: 0.03\n      predicted_depth_distribution_2026:\n        depth_0: 0.64\n        depth_1: 0.23\n        depth_2: 0.08\n        depth_3_plus: 0.05\n      spearman_rho_alignscore_vs_predicted_depth: -0.31\n      spearman_rho_alignscore_p: \"<0.001\"\n      spearman_rho_ttr_vs_predicted_depth: -0.27\n      spearman_rho_ttr_p: \"<0.001\"\n      spearman_rho_hapax_vs_predicted_depth: -0.24\n      spearman_rho_hapax_p: \"<0.001\"\n      cross_snapshot_rank_correlation: 0.94\n      estimated_synthetic_rate_2025: 0.28\n      estimated_synthetic_rate_2026: 0.36\n      depth_2plus_rate_increase_2025_to_2026: \"+2.7pp\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下，depth classifier 在野外数据上展现有意义的 correlation，因为：\n      (1) 15D model-free features 的跨模型迁移性（80-92% retention）保证了对未知生成器的文本也有泛化能力；\n      (2) AlignScore 与 depth 的负相关反映了递归生成中的 factual drift——每代生成丢失部分事实锚定，\n      与 DPI 理论的信息单调损失一致；\n      (3) TTR 和 hapax ratio 的下降对应 vocabulary narrowing，这是 model collapse 文献\n      (Shumailov et al.) 报告的首要症状，在 prompt-chain 场景中以更温和的形式出现；\n      (4) 2026 snapshot 比 2025 有更高的合成比例（+8pp），符合 recursive contamination 加速的\n      macro trend；(5) 跨 snapshot 的 rank correlation 0.94 说明 depth predictor 的排序在\n      时间上稳定，不是对特定 snapshot 的 artifact。\n      注意 |ρ| 在 0.24-0.31 范围——这是 expected 的，因为 depth 只是文本质量的一个维度，\n      AlignScore/TTR 受主题、长度、来源等多因素影响。best 档的关键不是高 correlation，\n      而是 consistent direction + statistical significance + cross-snapshot stability。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Common Crawl Depth Distribution (2025 vs 2026)\"\n        columns: [\"Predicted Depth\", \"CC 2025-03\", \"CC 2026-01\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (human)\", \"72%\", \"64%\", \"-8pp\"]\n          - [\"1\", \"19%\", \"23%\", \"+4pp\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"6%\", \"8%\", \"+2pp\"]\n          - [\"≥3\", \"3%\", \"5%\", \"+2pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Correlation with Independent Quality Metrics\"\n        columns: [\"Quality Metric\", \"Spearman ρ vs Predicted Depth\", \"p-value\", \"Direction\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"AlignScore\", \"-0.31\", \"<0.001\", \"deeper → less factual\"]\n          - [\"Type-Token Ratio\", \"-0.27\", \"<0.001\", \"deeper → less diverse\"]\n          - [\"Hapax Ratio\", \"-0.24\", \"<0.001\", \"deeper → fewer rare words\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 2D density plot — predicted depth (x) vs AlignScore (y), with marginal histograms. 清晰展示 depth 0 cluster 与 depth 1+ 的分离，以及 depth 2+ 的 AlignScore 进一步下降。\"\n      - \"Fig: Stacked bar chart comparing 2025 vs 2026 depth distributions,标注 synthetic rate increase。\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验在 best 档下提供 ecological validity，但定位为 supporting evidence 而非核心 claim。\n      论文在 Section 5.x 用一段话报告关键数字，强调三点：(1) depth predictor 在未见过的\n      wild data 上给出方向正确的排序；(2) 合成比例的时间趋势与 recursive contamination\n      concern 一致；(3) |ρ| 的 moderate magnitude 是 expected 的，不 overclaim。\n      Appendix 放完整的 per-depth breakdown 和 bootstrap CI。\n      审稿人视角：这弥补了 \"lab conditions only\" 的潜在质疑，但不是 make-or-break——\n      即使 correlation 更弱（|ρ|~0.15），核心 C1' claim 仍基于 controlled experiments。\n\n  - name: \"exp-028 Subsampling Power Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-028\"\n    description: >\n      从 exp-001 (Pythia C4, n=5000) 的完整数据中，以 n={1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} \n      做 10 次有放回 bootstrap resample，每次重新训练 LightGBM 并计算 1v2 AUC 和 K* 判定，\n      绘制 power curve 和 CI width 收敛图。\n    expected_results:\n      power_curve:\n        n_1000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6498\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.0182\n          ci_width_mean: 0.0385\n          kstar_2_fraction: 0.7\n          kstar_2_ci_lower_above_060_fraction: 0.5\n        n_2000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6528\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.0112\n          ci_width_mean: 0.0265\n          kstar_2_fraction: 0.9\n          kstar_2_ci_lower_above_060_fraction: 0.8\n        n_3000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6535\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.0085\n          ci_width_mean: 0.0215\n          kstar_2_fraction: 1.0\n          kstar_2_ci_lower_above_060_fraction: 0.9\n        n_4000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6538\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.0068\n          ci_width_mean: 0.0188\n          kstar_2_fraction: 1.0\n          kstar_2_ci_lower_above_060_fraction: 1.0\n        n_5000:\n          mean_1v2_auc: 0.6539\n          std_1v2_auc: 0.0058\n          ci_width_mean: 0.0176\n          kstar_2_fraction: 1.0\n          kstar_2_ci_lower_above_060_fraction: 1.0\n      minimum_n_for_robust_kstar: 3000\n      ci_width_convergence_rate: \"~1/√n\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下 power curve 展现清晰的收敛行为，因为：\n      (1) Pythia 1v2 AUC=0.6539 距 θ=0.60 有 5.4pp margin，属于 moderate effect size，\n      n=3000 即可稳定检测（power > 0.90）；\n      (2) CI width 按经典 1/√n 速率收缩——从 n=1000 的 ~0.039 到 n=5000 的 ~0.018，\n      这符合 bootstrap CI 的理论预期；\n      (3) n=1000 时 K*=2 判定率仅 70%，因为 individual resample 的 CI 过宽，\n      部分 CI lower 落在 0.60 以下，但 point estimate 仍以 K*=2 为主；\n      (4) n=3000 是 \"sweet spot\"——K*=2 在 10/10 resamples 稳定，CI lower > 0.60 率达 90%；\n      (5) 这一结果也解释了为什么 OLMo (1v2=0.6145, 1.45pp margin) 和 Qwen-cont (1v2=0.6112, 1.12pp margin)\n      在 n=5000 下仍 CI-robust：即使 margin 小，5000 样本足以支撑检测。\n      如果 effect size 更大（如 Pythia greedy 1v2=0.88），n=500 就够了——\n      但 continuation mode 的 boundary-pair signal 本身较弱，需要 3000+ 样本。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Power Curve — Sample Size vs K*=2 Detection Robustness\"\n        columns: [\"n\", \"Mean 1v2 AUC\", \"SD\", \"CI Width\", \"K*=2 Rate\", \"CI Lower > θ Rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1,000\", \"0.6498\", \"0.0182\", \"0.0385\", \"7/10\", \"5/10\"]\n          - [\"2,000\", \"0.6528\", \"0.0112\", \"0.0265\", \"9/10\", \"8/10\"]\n          - [\"3,000\", \"0.6535\", \"0.0085\", \"0.0215\", \"10/10\", \"9/10\"]\n          - [\"4,000\", \"0.6538\", \"0.0068\", \"0.0188\", \"10/10\", \"10/10\"]\n          - [\"5,000\", \"0.6539\", \"0.0058\", \"0.0176\", \"10/10\", \"10/10\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双 y 轴图。左轴：mean 1v2 AUC ± 1SD ribbon（蓝），水平虚线标 θ=0.60。右轴：K*=2 CI-robust detection rate（红阶梯线）。X 轴为 n。清晰展示 n=3000 为 elbow point。\"\n    analysis: >\n      此实验直接回应 reviewer concern \"样本量够吗\"。best 档下的叙事：\n      (1) n=3000 足以在 Pythia（margin=5.4pp）上 100% 稳定检测 K*=2；\n      (2) 我们使用 n=5000 提供额外 margin，尤其是对 OLMo/Qwen-cont 等 weaker-signal 配置；\n      (3) arXiv K*=3 的 2v3 AUC=0.6427（margin=4.3pp）在 n=2200 下 CI-robust，\n      与 power curve 预测一致（~4pp margin at n≥2000 应有 ~80% CI-robust rate）；\n      (4) 结论：our sample sizes are well-powered for the observed effect sizes。\n      放 Appendix，主文一句话引用。\n\n  - name: \"exp_32b_c4 — Qwen2.5-32B C4 Depth Chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_32b_c4\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-32B-Instruct, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, \n      depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B. 验证 K*=2 在 32B 规模不变。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9485\n        1v2: 0.6182\n        2v3: 0.5512\n        3v4: 0.5218\n        4v5: 0.5127\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.1025\n        1v2: 0.0108\n        2v3: 0.0058\n        3v4: 0.0041\n        4v5: 0.0033\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1:\n          auc: 0.9485\n          ci_lower: 0.9448\n          ci_upper: 0.9521\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6182\n          ci_lower: 0.6088\n          ci_upper: 0.6278\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5512\n          ci_lower: 0.5408\n          ci_upper: 0.5614\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        3v4:\n          auc: 0.5218\n          ci_lower: 0.5112\n          ci_upper: 0.5325\n          perm_p: 0.0003\n        4v5:\n          auc: 0.5127\n          ci_lower: 0.5018\n          ci_upper: 0.5237\n          perm_p: 0.0092\n      bootstrap_resamples: 10000\n      permutation_resamples: 10000\n      ordinal_mae: 1.2082\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3548\n      top_features:\n        - freq_entropy\n        - surp_d1_skew\n        - surp_std\n        - surp_d1_mean\n        - surp_d2_mean\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下 32B 给出 K*=2，CI lower=0.6088 > 0.605（满足 A6），因为：\n      (1) K*=2 已在 1.4B/1.5B/7B/8B/14B 六个规模点上 consistent（C4 域），\n      32B 延续这一趋势是 DPI 理论的直接预测——K* 由 text-intrinsic information loss 决定，\n      不受模型规模调控；\n      (2) 0v1 AUC=0.9485 略低于 14B 的 0.9598，这并非 anomaly：\n      更大的模型生成更 human-like 的 gen-1 文本，使 0v1 略微收窄，\n      但仍远高于 θ（+34.85pp），binary detection 完全不受影响；\n      (3) 1v2 AUC=0.6182 与 14B 的 0.621 几乎相同（Δ=-0.3pp），\n      表明 scale 从 14B→32B 对 boundary-pair discriminability 无额外影响——\n      depth signal saturation 已在更小规模达到渐近；\n      (4) CI lower=0.6088 给出 +0.88pp margin over θ，比 LLaMA-8B 的 +0.28pp \n      和 Qwen-cont-1.5B 的 +0.15pp 更 robust，因为 32B 的生成质量更高，\n      depth-1 vs depth-2 的 feature distribution 分离略好于边缘情况；\n      (5) top features 排序与 7B/14B 一致（freq_entropy 居首），\n      确认 feature importance 的 scale invariance；\n      (6) 2v3 CI upper=0.5614 < 0.60 确认 saturation boundary 在 K*=2，\n      没有被 32B 的表达能力 \"推高\" 到 K*=3。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Scale Invariance of K* on C4 Web Text\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Scale\", \"1v2 AUC\", \"1v2 CI Lower\", \"2v3 AUC\", \"2v3 CI Upper\", \"K*\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pythia-1.4B\", \"1.4B\", \"0.6539\", \"0.6454\", \"0.5515\", \"0.5628\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-1.5B base\", \"1.5B\", \"0.6262\", \"0.6168\", \"0.5496\", \"0.5600\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-1.5B inst.\", \"1.5B\", \"0.6112\", \"0.6015\", \"0.5609\", \"0.5712\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-7B\", \"7B\", \"0.6178\", \"0.6079\", \"0.5460\", \"0.5594\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"LLaMA-3.1-8B\", \"8B\", \"0.6123\", \"0.6028\", \"0.5274\", \"0.5378\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-14B\", \"14B\", \"0.6210\", \"0.6119\", \"0.5494\", \"0.5594\", \"2\"]\n          - [\"**Qwen2.5-32B**\", \"**32B**\", \"**0.6182**\", \"**0.6088**\", \"**0.5512**\", \"**0.5614**\", \"**2**\"]\n      - name: \"Table: 32B Full Pairwise AUC Profile\"\n        columns: [\"Pair\", \"AUC\", \"95% CI\", \"perm p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0v1\", \"0.9485\", \"[0.9448, 0.9521]\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"1v2\", \"0.6182\", \"[0.6088, 0.6278]\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"2v3\", \"0.5512\", \"[0.5408, 0.5614]\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"3v4\", \"0.5218\", \"[0.5112, 0.5325]\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"4v5\", \"0.5127\", \"[0.5018, 0.5237]\", \"0.009\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: AUC decay curve — 7 model scales (1.4B→32B) 叠加绘制 pairwise AUC vs depth pair。所有曲线在 1v2→2v3 间出现 sharp drop below θ=0.60，K*=2 boundary 在所有 scales 完全重合。32B 用加粗线标注。\"\n    analysis: >\n      32B 实验在 best 档下封锁 \"只测小模型\" 的 reviewer objection。\n      关键论证链：1.4B→32B 覆盖 23× scale range，K*=2 完全不变，\n      1v2 AUC 在 [0.6112, 0.6539] 的窄 band 内，没有 scale-dependent trend。\n      这与 DPI 理论一致：K* 是 text-intrinsic lossy channel 的属性，\n      模型规模影响 gen-0→gen-1 的 fidelity（0v1 AUC 从 0.997→0.949 缓降），\n      但不改变 depth saturation point。\n      论文中放 Section 4 主表（7 行 scale comparison），一句话结论：\n      \"K*=2 is invariant across a 23× scale range (1.4B–32B).\"\n      Appendix 放完整 32B pairwise profile。\n\n  - name: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated — arXiv Negative Result Integration\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\"\n    description: >\n      将 exp-026 arXiv graduated filtering 的负向结果整合入论文：\n      Section 5 增加 arXiv null result table，Discussion 增加 \n      \"K* characterizes discriminability, not data utility\" 洞察。\n    expected_results:\n      section_5_table:\n        strategies: [\"no_filter\", \"binary\", \"graduated_a09\"]\n        mmlu: [\"0.5899±0.0008\", \"0.5876±0.0004\", \"0.5900±0.0011\"]\n        hellaswag: [\"0.6600±0.0002\", \"0.6642±0.0004\", \"0.6599±0.0003\"]\n        graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_p: 0.87\n        graduated_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_p: 0.71\n        binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_p: 0.005\n        binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_p: \"<0.00001\"\n      exp_025_pythia_table:\n        strategies: [\"no_filter\", \"binary_ours\", \"graduated_a09\"]\n        mmlu: [\"0.2568±0.0012\", \"0.2585±0.0004\", \"0.2561±0.0009\"]\n        hellaswag: [\"0.5250±0.0008\", \"0.5251±0.0001\", \"0.5253±0.0007\"]\n        max_delta: 0.0017\n        key: \"all within noise\"\n      discussion_insight: \"K* characterizes statistical discriminability of generational depth, not downstream data utility. Depth 2-3 arXiv text is distinguishable (AUC=0.64) but not necessarily detrimental for training.\"\n      reviewer_credibility_boost: \"+0.3 avg score estimated\"\n      narrative_framing: \"honest negative result as mature science\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下，负向结果整合提升而非损害论文，因为：\n      (1) exp-026 graduated ≈ no_filter 在 arXiv 上（p>0.70 both metrics）直接否定了\n      \"K*=3 意味着 graduated filtering 在 arXiv 上应该更好\" 的朴素预测——\n      但这恰恰揭示了一个更深的洞察：K* 测量的是 statistical discriminability，\n      不是 data utility。depth-2 和 depth-3 的 arXiv 文本虽然可区分（AUC=0.64），\n      但两者对下游训练的边际价值差异可能微乎其微，因为 arXiv 的结构化特征\n      （LaTeX, citations）保持了即使在高代际下的语义连贯性；\n      (2) exp-025 Pythia filtering null result（所有策略 Δ<0.002）进一步支撑：\n      小模型（1.4B）capacity 不足以从 depth-aware filtering 中获益，\n      这是 model capacity × filtering benefit 的 interaction 而非 K* 理论的失败；\n      (3) 审稿人对 honest negative results 有 well-documented positive bias——\n      EMNLP reviewer guidelines 明确鼓励报告负向结果。在 best 档下，\n      审稿人的评价会是 \"The authors demonstrate intellectual honesty by reporting \n      negative results and extracting a deeper insight\"；\n      (4) \"K* ≠ data utility\" 洞察为 future work 开辟了明确方向：\n      何时 discriminability 转化为 utility？这取决于 domain、model capacity、\n      和 contamination ratio 的三方交互——论文 honestly 承认目前不完全理解这一问题；\n      (5) binary filtering 在 C4 上的持续优势（HellaSwag p≤0.004 across 3 dose ratios）\n      与 arXiv null result 形成对比，进一步证明 domain dependence 是关键：\n      K*=2 域的 binary 策略有效 vs K*=3 域的 graduated 策略无额外收益。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (Section 5): arXiv Filtering Results (K*=3 Domain)\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"vs no_filter (MMLU)\", \"vs no_filter (HS)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"no_filter\", \"0.5899±0.0008\", \"0.6600±0.0002\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"binary\", \"0.5876±0.0004\", \"0.6642±0.0004\", \"-0.23pp (p=0.005)\", \"+0.42pp (p<10⁻⁵)\"]\n          - [\"graduated (α=0.9)\", \"0.5900±0.0011\", \"0.6599±0.0003\", \"+0.01pp (p=0.87)\", \"-0.01pp (p=0.71)\"]\n      - name: \"Table (Appendix): exp-025 Pythia Filtering Null Result\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"no_filter\", \"0.2568±0.0012\", \"0.5250±0.0008\"]\n          - [\"binary_ours\", \"0.2585±0.0004\", \"0.5251±0.0001\"]\n          - [\"graduated_a09\", \"0.2561±0.0009\", \"0.5253±0.0007\"]\n      - name: \"Table (Discussion): K* vs Filtering Effectiveness Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Domain\", \"K*\", \"Binary Advantage\", \"Graduated vs No-filter\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"C4 (web)\", \"2\", \"significant (HS p≤0.004)\", \"≈ no_filter\", \"K*=2 → binary optimal\"]\n          - [\"arXiv\", \"3\", \"metric-specific trade-off\", \"≈ no_filter\", \"discriminability ≠ utility\"]\n          - [\"Pythia C4\", \"2\", \"within noise\", \"within noise\", \"model capacity prerequisite\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双面 comparison——左 panel C4 dose-response (binary consistently above), 右 panel arXiv null result (all strategies collapsed)。视觉上立即传达 domain-dependent filtering effectiveness。\"\n    analysis: >\n      此整合是 best 档区别于其他档位的关键特征。\n      exp-025 和 exp-026 的负向结果不是弱点，而是叙事武器：\n      它们将 C3 从 \"binary filtering is universally best\" 的过度 claim\n      收窄到 \"K* predicts optimal curation granularity for domains where K*=2,\n      but discriminability does not automatically translate to filtering benefit\"——\n      这是一个更精确、更可辩护、更有科学深度的 claim。\n      Discussion 中 \"K* characterizes discriminability, not data utility\" \n      作为论文最后的概念性 takeaway 与 one-wash laundering 形成双 memorable insight。\n      审稿人评估：这一诚实报告预计提升 soundness/rigour 维度 0.3-0.5 分，\n      因为它展示了作者对 claim boundaries 的精确认知。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d8df4ac7-1a33-44a5-a0a1-8f56500212ae","total_cost_usd":0.58840725,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49603,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":9112,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49603,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":9112,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49603,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49603},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":44563,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.044657999999999996,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":9112,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":49603,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5437492500000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off"